    "다른 해의 월급도 한 줄 더 넣으면 구매력 변화가 보여요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the wage comparison works.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add another year's salary to see how your buying power changed."
