    "평가액이 가려져 손익·수익률로 계산했어요. 확인해 주세요." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip that appears when the user hides the amount in a holding.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Market value was hidden, so we calculated from gain/loss and return. Please check."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Market value was hidden, so we calculated from gain/loss and return. Please check."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "評価額が隠れていたため、損益とリターンから計算しました。ご確認ください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "估值被遮挡，所以根据盈亏和收益率算出。请确认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "估值被遮擋，所以根據盈虧和報酬率算出。請確認。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El valor de mercado estaba oculto, así que calculamos con la ganancia/pérdida y la rentabilidad. Compruébalo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Marktwert war verdeckt, daher haben wir aus Gewinn/Verlust und Rendite gerechnet. Bitte prüfen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
